+**Private Cloud Compute routing:** Version {{version}} decides where final synthesis runs only after retrieval, when the evidence and real context size are known. On iOS and macOS 27 a long evidence-heavy request uses Private Cloud Compute only after the app shows the exact payload and receives permission; on older systems every route resolves on-device. Retrieval and verification stay local, and every answer carries a route badge.
 
 **Local retrieval & verification:** Parsing, Vision OCR, indexing, SQLite FTS5 and vector search, reranking, evidence packing, citation checks, and abstention all run on-device. The app still works in airplane mode through its on-device answer path and does not require an account or API key.
 
